      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The menu preview pose uses the default state of the Locomotion layer. You can at least pose the avatar by adding a menu-specific animation as the default state. Non-humanoid bone transforms are supported. Then transition out of the default state to the actual locomotion tree using the condition TrackingType Greater than 0 and a transition duration of 0.",
